              "applicationStartsInScreening",
              "applicationActiveWhileInPipeline",
              "daysInPipelineCalculated"
            ],
            "jsdoc": {
              "purpose": "Records a new application of a candidate to an open position.",
              "input": "candidateId: the candidate picked; jobPositionId: the open position picked.",
              "processing": "Only a recruiter may record (recruiterMovesScreeningAndInterview). Refuses if the position is not open (applicationOnlyToOpenPosition) or if the candidate already has an active application (screening, interview or offer) to the same position (oneActiveApplicationPerCandidateAndPosition). Issues applicationNumber from the sequence hiringPipeline.Application (applicationNumberFromSequence), sets status screening (applicationStartsInScreening) and appliedAt today. isActive and daysInPipeline are computed for the response, not stored.",
              "output": "The new application as a list row (inserted into the queue) and as a detail, so the page redraws without another call."
            }
          },
